name=SmoothRide MP [B42]
id=SmoothRide
author=druid
description=Smooth multiplayer vehicles. Remote cars are drawn ~60-100 ms behind instead of 500+ ms, follow a curve built from the driver's speed instead of straight segments, and never pop: prediction misses are blended out. The driver sends its car state ~30 times a second instead of ~6. Server hitches (world save, map loading) are bridged by prediction: no freeze, no teleport. Settings: the host's sandbox options, page SmoothRide (an admin can change them in a running game). Client-side Java (ZombieBuddy); every player needs it. If the game build does not match, it switches itself off and vanilla sync is used.
require=\ZombieBuddy
category=vehicle
versionMin=42.21
modversion=1.1.0
javaJarFile=media/java/SmoothRide.jar
javaPkgName=com.druid.smoothride
ZBVersionMin=2.3.4
